# Kearsarge Regional School District (SAU 65) — the district that governs
# 03255's schools, and the eight towns inside it. Read 2026-08-20, NH Hunt.
#
# Found by rung 10, the sitemap: kearsarge.org publishes 496 URLs at
# /sitemap.xml and the board pages are not linked from the front page's
# top-level menu. The district runs the SAME Drupal 7 CMS as the Town of
# Newbury — same `views-table` roster shape, same `views-field-*` classes — so
# layer 5 reads both without a second parser. That is the class, not the
# instance.
https://www.kearsarge.org/district/school-board-mbc/pages/school-board-members	KRSD School Board
https://www.kearsarge.org/district/school-board-mbc/pages/mbc-overview-members	KRSD Municipal Budget Committee
https://www.kearsarge.org/district/district/pages/contact-us	KRSD district office
https://www.kearsarge.org/district/district/pages/employee-directory	KRSD employee directory
https://www.kearsarge.org/boards	KRSD boards index
https://www.kearsarge.org/district/school-board-mbc/pages/school-board-meeting-schedule	KRSD School Board meeting schedule
